window.Handbook.register({"id":"ch242","pages":[{"n":1785,"html":"<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1365\"></span><h2 class=\"book-heading\">第241 章IIO 概述</h2>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">IIO 子系统的开发始于2009 年，IIO（Industrial Input/Output，工业输入/输出）是Linux 内核中专门用于处理与模数转换器（ADC）、数模转换器（DAC）以及其他工业传感器相关设备的子系统，。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">随着嵌入式系统和物联网（IoT）技术的兴起，越来越多的设备需要与模拟或数字信号交互。典型场景包括。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">（1）模数转换（ADC）：将温度、压力、光强度等模拟信号转换为数字信号；</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">（2）数模转换（DAC）：将数字信号转换为模拟信号（如控制电机的速度或音量）；</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">（3）其他传感器：加速度计、陀螺仪、磁力计等；</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">这些设备功能各异，但均需与操作系统进行交互。若缺乏统一框架，每个设备都需要单独开发驱动程序，会造成代码冗余、维护困难。为此，Linux 社区引入了IIO 子系统，以实现对这类设备的标准化管理。IIO 子系统特点</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">（1）统一接口：IIO 子系统提供了标准化API 与数据结构，使不同类型设备可通过相同接口交互。如用户空间应用程序可以通过标准的文件系统接口（/sys/bus/iio/devices/）访问IIO设备。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">（2）支持多种设备类型：IIO 子系统兼容多种设备类型，包括ADC（模数转换器）、DAC（数模转换器）、温度传感器、光传感器、压力传感器以及加速度计、陀螺仪。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">（3）事件和触发机制：IIO 子系统支持基于事件的触发机制（如传感器数值超过阈值时触发中断）。</p>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1366\"></span><h2 class=\"book-heading\">第242 章IIO 设备注册流程分析</h2>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">在本章节以ADC 按键为例，对IIO 设备的注册流程进行分析。</p>"},{"n":1786,"html":"<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1367\"></span><h3 class=\"book-heading\">242.1 rockchip_saradc_probe 函数分析</h3>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">打开iTOP-RK3568 内核源码下的rk3568.dtsi 设备树文件，找到SARADC 的设备节点，具体内容如代码清单242.1 所示：</p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单242.1</p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"11\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"source-line\">    saradc: saradc@fe720000 {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\">        compatible = &quot;rockchip,rk3568-saradc&quot;, &quot;rockchip,rk3399-saradc&quot;;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"source-line\">        reg = &lt;0x0 0xfe720000 0x0 0x100&gt;;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><span class=\"source-line\">        interrupts = &lt;GIC_SPI 93 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH&gt;;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</span><span class=\"source-line\">        #io-channel-cells = &lt;1&gt;;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6</span><span class=\"source-line\">        clocks = &lt;&amp;cru CLK_SARADC&gt;, &lt;&amp;cru PCLK_SARADC&gt;;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7</span><span class=\"source-line\">        clock-names = &quot;saradc&quot;, &quot;apb_pclk&quot;;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8</span><span class=\"source-line\">        resets = &lt;&amp;cru SRST_P_SARADC&gt;;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9</span><span class=\"source-line\">        reset-names = &quot;saradc-apb&quot;;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10</span><span class=\"source-line\">        status = &quot;disabled&quot;;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11</span><span class=\"source-line\">    };</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1786 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1786\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">然后通过compatible 匹配值找到对应的驱动文件drivers/iio/adc/rockchip_saradc.c，它的pr obe 函数内容如代码清单242.2 所示：</p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单242.2</p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"21\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"source-line\">static int rockchip_saradc_probe(struct platform_device *pdev)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\">{</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct rockchip_saradc *info = NULL;  // 定义SARADC 设备私有数据结构指针</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct device_node *np = pdev-&gt;dev.of_node;  // 获取设备树节点</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct iio_dev *indio_dev = NULL;  // 定义IIO 设备结构体指针</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct resource *mem;  // 用于获取内存资源</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7</span><span class=\"source-line\">    const struct of_device_id *match;  // 用于匹配设备树节点</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8</span><span class=\"source-line\">    int ret;  // 用于存储函数返回值</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9</span><span class=\"source-line\">    int irq;  // 用于存储中断号</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 检查设备树节点是否存在</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (!np)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13</span><span class=\"source-line\">        return -ENODEV;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 分配IIO 设备结构体，并为其分配私有数据空间</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16</span><span class=\"source-line\">    indio_dev = devm_iio_device_alloc(&amp;pdev-&gt;dev, sizeof(*info));</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (!indio_dev) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">18</span><span class=\"source-line\">        dev_err(&amp;pdev-&gt;dev, &quot;failed allocating iio device\\n&quot;);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">19</span><span class=\"source-line\">        return -ENOMEM;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">20</span><span class=\"source-line\">    }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">21</span><span class=\"source-line\">    info = iio_priv(indio_dev);  // 获取IIO 设备的私有数据区域</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1786 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1786\">核对原页</button></p></div>"},{"n":1787,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"22\" data-end=\"65\" data-contiguous=\"true\" data-recovered=\"pdf-text\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">22</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">23</span><span class=\"source-line\">// 匹配设备树中的设备  ID</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">24</span><span class=\"source-line\">match = of_match_device(rockchip_saradc_match, &amp;pdev-&gt;dev);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">25</span><span class=\"source-line\">if (!match) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">26</span><span class=\"source-line\">        dev_err(&amp;pdev-&gt;dev, \"failed to match device\\n\");</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">27</span><span class=\"source-line\">        return -ENODEV;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">28</span><span class=\"source-line\">}</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">29</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">30</span><span class=\"source-line\">info-&gt;data = match-&gt;data;    // 获取设备匹配的数据</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">31</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">32</span><span class=\"source-line\">// 获取设备的寄存器地址资源</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">33</span><span class=\"source-line\">mem = platform_get_resource(pdev, IORESOURCE_MEM, 0);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">34</span><span class=\"source-line\">info-&gt;regs = devm_ioremap_resource(&amp;pdev-&gt;dev, mem);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">35</span><span class=\"source-line\">if (IS_ERR(info-&gt;regs))</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">36</span><span class=\"source-line\">        return PTR_ERR(info-&gt;regs);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">37</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">38</span><span class=\"source-line\">info-&gt;reset = devm_reset_control_get_exclusive(&amp;pdev-&gt;dev, \"saradc-apb\");</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">39</span><span class=\"source-line\">if (IS_ERR(info-&gt;reset)) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">40</span><span class=\"source-line\">        ret = PTR_ERR(info-&gt;reset);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">41</span><span class=\"source-line\">        if (ret != -ENOENT)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">42</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 return ret;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">43</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">44</span><span class=\"source-line\">        dev_dbg(&amp;pdev-&gt;dev, \"no reset control found\\n\");</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">45</span><span class=\"source-line\">        info-&gt;reset = NULL;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">46</span><span class=\"source-line\">}</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">47</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">48</span><span class=\"source-line\">init_completion(&amp;info-&gt;completion);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">49</span><span class=\"source-line\">// 获取中断号</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">50</span><span class=\"source-line\">irq = platform_get_irq(pdev, 0);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">58</span><span class=\"source-line\">if (irq &lt; 0) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">52</span><span class=\"source-line\">        dev_err(&amp;pdev-&gt;dev, \"no irq resource?\\n\");</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">53</span><span class=\"source-line\">        return irq;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">54</span><span class=\"source-line\">}</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">55</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">56</span><span class=\"source-line\">// 注册中断处理函数</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">57</span><span class=\"source-line\">ret = devm_request_irq(&amp;pdev-&gt;dev, irq, rockchip_saradc_isr,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">58</span><span class=\"source-line\">                               0, dev_name(&amp;pdev-&gt;dev), info);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">59</span><span class=\"source-line\">if (ret &lt; 0) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">60</span><span class=\"source-line\">        dev_err(&amp;pdev-&gt;dev, \"failed requesting irq %d\\n\", irq);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">61</span><span class=\"source-line\">        return ret;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">62</span><span class=\"source-line\">}</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">63</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">64</span><span class=\"source-line\">// 获取  APB 总线时钟</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">65</span><span class=\"source-line\">info-&gt;pclk = devm_clk_get(&amp;pdev-&gt;dev, \"apb_pclk\");</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">从原书文字层恢复 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1787\">核对原页</button></p></div>"},{"n":1788,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"66\" data-end=\"109\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">66</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (IS_ERR(info-&gt;pclk)) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">67</span><span class=\"source-line\">        dev_err(&amp;pdev-&gt;dev, &quot;failed to get pclk\\n&quot;);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">68</span><span class=\"source-line\">        return PTR_ERR(info-&gt;pclk);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">69</span><span class=\"source-line\">    }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">70</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">71</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 获取SARADC 转换器时钟</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">72</span><span class=\"source-line\">    info-&gt;clk = devm_clk_get(&amp;pdev-&gt;dev, &quot;saradc&quot;);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">73</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (IS_ERR(info-&gt;clk)) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">74</span><span class=\"source-line\">        dev_err(&amp;pdev-&gt;dev, &quot;failed to get adc clock\\n&quot;);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">75</span><span class=\"source-line\">        return PTR_ERR(info-&gt;clk);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">76</span><span class=\"source-line\">    }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">77</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">78</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 获取参考电压调节器</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">79</span><span class=\"source-line\">    info-&gt;vref = devm_regulator_get(&amp;pdev-&gt;dev, &quot;vref&quot;);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">80</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (IS_ERR(info-&gt;vref)) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">81</span><span class=\"source-line\">        dev_err(&amp;pdev-&gt;dev, &quot;failed to get regulator, %ld\\n&quot;,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">82</span><span class=\"source-line\">            PTR_ERR(info-&gt;vref));</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">83</span><span class=\"source-line\">        return PTR_ERR(info-&gt;vref);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">84</span><span class=\"source-line\">    }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">85</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">86</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 如果存在复位控制器，则执行复位操作</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">87</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (info-&gt;reset)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">88</span><span class=\"source-line\">        rockchip_saradc_reset_controller(info-&gt;reset);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">89</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">90</span><span class=\"source-line\">    /*</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">91</span><span class=\"source-line\">     * 设置转换器时钟频率，默认使用设备数据中的时钟频率</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">92</span><span class=\"source-line\">     */</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">93</span><span class=\"source-line\">    ret = clk_set_rate(info-&gt;clk, info-&gt;data-&gt;clk_rate);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">94</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (ret &lt; 0) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">95</span><span class=\"source-line\">        dev_err(&amp;pdev-&gt;dev, &quot;failed to set adc clk rate, %d\\n&quot;, ret);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">96</span><span class=\"source-line\">        return ret;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">97</span><span class=\"source-line\">    }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">98</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">99</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 启用参考电压调节器</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">100</span><span class=\"source-line\">    ret = regulator_enable(info-&gt;vref);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">101</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (ret &lt; 0) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">102</span><span class=\"source-line\">        dev_err(&amp;pdev-&gt;dev, &quot;failed to enable vref regulator\\n&quot;);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">103</span><span class=\"source-line\">        return ret;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">104</span><span class=\"source-line\">    }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">105</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 注册清理动作</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">106</span><span class=\"source-line\">    ret = devm_add_action_or_reset(&amp;pdev-&gt;dev,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">107</span><span class=\"source-line\">                       rockchip_saradc_regulator_disable, info);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">108</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (ret) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">109</span><span class=\"source-line\">        dev_err(&amp;pdev-&gt;dev, &quot;failed to register devm action, %d\\n&quot;,ret);</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1788 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1788\">核对原页</button></p></div>"},{"n":1789,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"110\" data-end=\"153\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">110</span><span class=\"source-line\">        return ret;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">111</span><span class=\"source-line\">    }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">112</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">113</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 获取参考电压的实际值</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">114</span><span class=\"source-line\">    info-&gt;uv_vref = regulator_get_voltage(info-&gt;vref);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">115</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">116</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 启用APB 总线时钟</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">117</span><span class=\"source-line\">    ret = clk_prepare_enable(info-&gt;pclk);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">118</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (ret &lt; 0) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">119</span><span class=\"source-line\">        dev_err(&amp;pdev-&gt;dev, &quot;failed to enable pclk\\n&quot;);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">120</span><span class=\"source-line\">        return ret;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">121</span><span class=\"source-line\">    }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">122</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">123</span><span class=\"source-line\">    ret = devm_add_action_or_reset(&amp;pdev-&gt;dev,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">124</span><span class=\"source-line\">                       rockchip_saradc_pclk_disable, info);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">125</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (ret) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">126</span><span class=\"source-line\">        dev_err(&amp;pdev-&gt;dev, &quot;failed to register devm action, %d\\n&quot;,ret);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">127</span><span class=\"source-line\">        return ret;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">128</span><span class=\"source-line\">    }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">129</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">130</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 启用SARADC 转换器时钟</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">131</span><span class=\"source-line\">    ret = clk_prepare_enable(info-&gt;clk);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">132</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (ret &lt; 0) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">133</span><span class=\"source-line\">        dev_err(&amp;pdev-&gt;dev, &quot;failed to enable converter clock\\n&quot;);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">134</span><span class=\"source-line\">        return ret;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">135</span><span class=\"source-line\">    }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">136</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">137</span><span class=\"source-line\">    ret = devm_add_action_or_reset(&amp;pdev-&gt;dev,rockchip_saradc_clk_disable, info);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">138</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (ret) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">139</span><span class=\"source-line\">        dev_err(&amp;pdev-&gt;dev, &quot;failed to register devm action, %d\\n&quot;,ret);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">140</span><span class=\"source-line\">        return ret;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">141</span><span class=\"source-line\">    }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">142</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">143</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 将IIO 设备与平台设备关联</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">144</span><span class=\"source-line\">    platform_set_drvdata(pdev, indio_dev);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">145</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">146</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 初始化IIO 设备的基本信息</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">147</span><span class=\"source-line\">    indio_dev-&gt;name = dev_name(&amp;pdev-&gt;dev);  // 设备名称</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">148</span><span class=\"source-line\">    indio_dev-&gt;dev.parent = &amp;pdev-&gt;dev;  // 父设备</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">149</span><span class=\"source-line\">    indio_dev-&gt;dev.of_node = pdev-&gt;dev.of_node;  // 设备树节点</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">150</span><span class=\"source-line\">    indio_dev-&gt;info = &amp;rockchip_saradc_iio_info;  // IIO 设备的操作函数集</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">151</span><span class=\"source-line\">    indio_dev-&gt;modes = INDIO_DIRECT_MODE;  // 设置工作模式为直接模式</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">152</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">153</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 配置通道信息</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1789 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1789\">核对原页</button></p></div>"},{"n":1790,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"154\" data-end=\"158\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">154</span><span class=\"source-line\">    indio_dev-&gt;channels = info-&gt;data-&gt;channels;  // 通道列表</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">155</span><span class=\"source-line\">    indio_dev-&gt;num_channels = info-&gt;data-&gt;num_channels;  // 通道数量</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">156</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 注册IIO 设备</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">157</span><span class=\"source-line\">    return devm_iio_device_register(&amp;pdev-&gt;dev, indio_dev);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">158</span><span class=\"source-line\">}</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1790 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1790\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">首先在第5 行定义了一个struct iio_dev 类型的变量indio_dev，它用来描述IIO 设备，该结构体包含了设备的关键信息和资源，通过该结构体，IIO 子系统能够统一管理和操作各种工业I/O 设备（如ADC、DAC、传感器等），该结构体的具体内容如代码清单242.3 所示：</p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单242.3</p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"16\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"source-line\">struct iio_dev {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\">    int id;  // 设备的id</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct module *driver_module;  // 指向驱动模块的指针</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</span><span class=\"source-line\">    int modes;  // 支持的工作模式</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6</span><span class=\"source-line\">    int currentmode;  // 当前的工作模式</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct device dev;  // 设备模型结构体</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct iio_event_interface *event_interface;  // 事件接口</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct iio_buffer *buffer;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct list_head buffer_list;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13</span><span class=\"source-line\">    int scan_bytes;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct mutex mlock;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15</span><span class=\"source-line\">     ...........................</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16</span><span class=\"source-line\">};</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1790 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1790\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">可以将iio_dev 看成一个描述IIO 设备的基类，那要如何区分ADC、DAC 这些不同IIO 设备呢？</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">这里看ADC 设备是如何描述的，ADC 设备是通过probe 函数第3 行的rockchip_saradc 结构体描述的，rockchip_saradc 结构体具体内容如代码清单242.4 所示：</p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单242.4</p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"9\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"source-line\">struct rockchip_saradc {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\">    void __iomem *regs;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct clk *pclk;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct clk *clk;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct completion completion;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct regulator *vref;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7</span><span class=\"source-line\">    int uv_vref;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct reset_control *reset;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9</span><span class=\"source-line\">    const struct rockchip_saradc_data *data;</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1790 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1790\">核对原页</button></p></div>"},{"n":1791,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"10\" data-end=\"12\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10</span><span class=\"source-line\">    u16 last_val;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11</span><span class=\"source-line\">    bool suspended;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12</span><span class=\"source-line\">};</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1791 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1791\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">在rockchip_saradc 结构体中是没有iio 相关描述的，那它和iio 设备是怎样联系起来的呢？带着疑问回到probe 函数，查看第16-21 行的内容。首先通过devm_iio_device_alloc()函数分配了一块连续的内存，用于存储iio_dev(iio 设备)及其私有数据（rockchip_saradc 结构体），从而将两个iio_dev 和rockchip_saradc 类型的结构体变量连接在了一起，然后使用iio_priv()函数获取私有数据首地址，具体内容如代码清单242.5 所示：</p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单242.5</p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"6\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"source-line\">      indio_dev = devm_iio_device_alloc(&amp;pdev-&gt;dev, sizeof(*info));</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\">      if (!indio_dev) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"source-line\">          dev_err(&amp;pdev-&gt;dev, &quot;failed allocating iio device\\n&quot;);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><span class=\"source-line\">          return -ENOMEM;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</span><span class=\"source-line\">      }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6</span><span class=\"source-line\">      info = iio_priv(indio_dev);  // 获取IIO 设备的私有数据区域</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1791 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1791\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">然后我们继续向下分析probe 源码，为了匹配多个SOC 芯片，在24-30 行通过of_match_d evice 函数对设备树传递过来的值与rockchip_saradc_match 进行匹配，rockchip_saradc_match结构体数组变量内容如代码清单242.6 所示：</p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单242.6</p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"16\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"source-line\">static const struct of_device_id rockchip_saradc_match[] = {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\">    {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"source-line\">        .compatible = &quot;rockchip,saradc&quot;,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><span class=\"source-line\">        .data = &amp;saradc_data,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</span><span class=\"source-line\">    }, {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6</span><span class=\"source-line\">        .compatible = &quot;rockchip,rk3066-tsadc&quot;,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7</span><span class=\"source-line\">        .data = &amp;rk3066_tsadc_data,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8</span><span class=\"source-line\">    }, {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9</span><span class=\"source-line\">        .compatible = &quot;rockchip,rk3399-saradc&quot;,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10</span><span class=\"source-line\">        .data = &amp;rk3399_saradc_data,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11</span><span class=\"source-line\">    }, {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12</span><span class=\"source-line\">        .compatible = &quot;rockchip,rk3568-saradc&quot;,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13</span><span class=\"source-line\">        .data = &amp;rk3568_saradc_data,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14</span><span class=\"source-line\">    },</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15</span><span class=\"source-line\">    {},</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16</span><span class=\"source-line\">};</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1791 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1791\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">rk3568 对应的数据指向了rk3568_saradc_data，该变量的具体内容如代码清单242.7 所示，这段代码的主要作用是定义了一个SARADC 设备的通道信息和具体的设备参数。</p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单242.7</p>"},{"n":1792,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"6\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"source-line\">static const struct rockchip_saradc_data rk3568_saradc_data = {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\">    .num_bits = 10,  // ADC 分辨率：10 位（即最大值为2^10 - 1 = 1023）</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"source-line\">    .channels = rockchip_rk3568_saradc_iio_channels,  // 指向通道规格数组</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><span class=\"source-line\">    .num_channels = ARRAY_SIZE(rockchip_rk3568_saradc_iio_channels),  // 通道数量：8 个</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</span><span class=\"source-line\">    .clk_rate = 1000000,  // 转换器时钟频率：1 MHz</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6</span><span class=\"source-line\">};</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1792 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1792\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">第3 行的rockchip_rk3568_saradc_iio_channels 表示通道规格数组，该数组的具体内容如代码清单242.8 所示，可以看到RK3568 有着8 个ADC 通道：</p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单242.8</p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"10\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"source-line\">static const struct iio_chan_spec rockchip_rk3568_saradc_iio_channels[] = {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\">    ADC_CHANNEL(0, &quot;adc0&quot;),  // 定义ADC 通道0，名称为&quot;adc0&quot;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"source-line\">    ADC_CHANNEL(1, &quot;adc1&quot;),  // 定义ADC 通道1，名称为&quot;adc1&quot;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><span class=\"source-line\">    ADC_CHANNEL(2, &quot;adc2&quot;),  // 定义ADC 通道2，名称为&quot;adc2&quot;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</span><span class=\"source-line\">    ADC_CHANNEL(3, &quot;adc3&quot;),  // 定义ADC 通道3，名称为&quot;adc3&quot;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6</span><span class=\"source-line\">    ADC_CHANNEL(4, &quot;adc4&quot;),  // 定义ADC 通道4，名称为&quot;adc4&quot;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7</span><span class=\"source-line\">    ADC_CHANNEL(5, &quot;adc5&quot;),  // 定义ADC 通道5，名称为&quot;adc5&quot;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8</span><span class=\"source-line\">    ADC_CHANNEL(6, &quot;adc6&quot;),  // 定义ADC 通道6，名称为&quot;adc6&quot;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9</span><span class=\"source-line\">    ADC_CHANNEL(7, &quot;adc7&quot;),  // 定义ADC 通道7，名称为&quot;adc7&quot;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10</span><span class=\"source-line\">};</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1792 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1792\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">用来描述通道规则的结构体为iio_chan_spec，其中定义了通道的类型、编号、数据格式、支持的属性及事件等信息，用来区分不同类型的ADC 或DAC 设备,该结构体的具体内容如代码清单242.9 所示：</p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单242.9</p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"17\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"source-line\">struct iio_chan_spec {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\">    enum iio_chan_type type;  // 通道类型（如电压、电流、温度等）</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"source-line\">    int        channel;  // 主通道编号</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><span class=\"source-line\">    int        channel2;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</span><span class=\"source-line\">    unsigned long      address;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6</span><span class=\"source-line\">    int        scan_index;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8</span><span class=\"source-line\">        char sign;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9</span><span class=\"source-line\">        u8   realbits;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10</span><span class=\"source-line\">        u8   storagebits;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11</span><span class=\"source-line\">        u8   shift;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12</span><span class=\"source-line\">        u8   repeat;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13</span><span class=\"source-line\">        enum iio_endian endianness;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14</span><span class=\"source-line\">    } scan_type;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15</span><span class=\"source-line\">    long        info_mask_separate;  // 单独支持的通道属性掩码（如原始值、缩放比例等）</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16</span><span class=\"source-line\">    long        info_mask_separate_available;  // 单独支持的可用属性掩码</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17</span><span class=\"source-line\">    long        info_mask_shared_by_type;  // 按类型共享的属性掩码</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1792 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1792\">核对原页</button></p></div>"},{"n":1793,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"18\" data-end=\"32\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">18</span><span class=\"source-line\">    long        info_mask_shared_by_type_available;  // 按类型共享的可用属性掩码</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">19</span><span class=\"source-line\">    long        info_mask_shared_by_dir;  // 按方向共享的属性掩码</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">20</span><span class=\"source-line\">    long        info_mask_shared_by_dir_available;  // 按方向共享的可用属性掩码</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">21</span><span class=\"source-line\">    long        info_mask_shared_by_all;  // 所有通道共享的属性掩码</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">22</span><span class=\"source-line\">    long        info_mask_shared_by_all_available;  // 所有通道共享的可用属性掩码</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">23</span><span class=\"source-line\">    const struct iio_event_spec *event_spec;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">24</span><span class=\"source-line\">    unsigned int       num_event_specs;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">25</span><span class=\"source-line\">    const struct iio_chan_spec_ext_info *ext_info;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">26</span><span class=\"source-line\">    const char     *extend_name;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">27</span><span class=\"source-line\">    const char     *datasheet_name;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">28</span><span class=\"source-line\">    unsigned      modified:1;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">29</span><span class=\"source-line\">    unsigned      indexed:1;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">30</span><span class=\"source-line\">    unsigned      output:1;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">31</span><span class=\"source-line\">    unsigned      differential:1;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">32</span><span class=\"source-line\">};</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1793 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1793\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">而RK3568 ADC 通道的定义使用的是ADC_CHANNEL 宏，该宏的具体内容如代码清单242.10所示：</p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单242.10</p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"8\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"source-line\">#define ADC_CHANNEL(_index, _id) {        \\</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\">    .type = IIO_VOLTAGE,  /* 通道类型：电压测量*/        \\</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"source-line\">    .indexed = 1,  /* 启用索引模式，表示使用channel 字段作为索引*/ \\</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><span class=\"source-line\">    .channel = _index,  /* 主通道编号，由宏参数_index 指定*/ \\</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</span><span class=\"source-line\">    .info_mask_separate = BIT(IIO_CHAN_INFO_RAW),  /* 单独支持的属性：原始值（RAW）*/ \\</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6</span><span class=\"source-line\">    .info_mask_shared_by_type = BIT(IIO_CHAN_INFO_SCALE),  /* 按类型共享的属性：缩放比例</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7</span><span class=\"source-line\">    .datasheet_name = _id,  /* 数据手册中的名称，由宏参数_id 指定*/ \\</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8</span><span class=\"source-line\">}</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1793 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1793\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">至此，关于创建RK3568 ADC 通道数据相关的代码就分析完成了，然后继续回到probe 函数。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">在32-141 行通过一系列API 从设备树获取对应的硬件属性并配置硬件资源。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">在147-155 行初始化IIO 设备的核心信息，包括设置设备属性、操作函数集、工作模式，以及配置通道列表和数量，为后续的数据采集和用户空间交互提供了基础信息。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">最后在第157 行通过devm_iio_device_register()函数注册了一个iio 设备，至此，关于saradc的probe 函数就讲解完成了，在下一小节将对devm_iio_device_register()函数进行讲解。</p>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1368\"></span><h3 class=\"book-heading\">242.2 devm_iio_device_register 函数分析</h3>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">devm_iio_device_register()函数实际上是一个宏定义，具体内容如代码清单242.11 所示：</p>"},{"n":1794,"html":"<p class=\"caption\">代码清单242.11</p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"2\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"source-line\">#define devm_iio_device_register(dev, indio_dev) \\</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\">    __devm_iio_device_register((dev), (indio_dev), THIS_MODULE)</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1794 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1794\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">实际调用的函数为__devm_iio_device_register()，该函数的具体内容如代码清单242.12 所示：</p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单242.12</p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"23\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"source-line\">int __devm_iio_device_register(struct device *dev, struct iio_dev *indio_dev,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\">                   struct module *this_mod)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"source-line\">{</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct iio_dev **ptr;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</span><span class=\"source-line\">    int ret;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 使用devres_alloc 分配设备资源管理结构</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8</span><span class=\"source-line\">    ptr = devres_alloc(devm_iio_device_unreg, sizeof(*ptr), GFP_KERNEL);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (!ptr)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10</span><span class=\"source-line\">        return -ENOMEM;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 将分配的资源管理指针指向传入的iio_dev 结构</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13</span><span class=\"source-line\">    *ptr = indio_dev;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 调用底层的设备注册函数__iio_device_register 注册iio_dev 设备</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16</span><span class=\"source-line\">    ret = __iio_device_register(indio_dev, this_mod);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (!ret) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">18</span><span class=\"source-line\">        devres_add(dev, ptr);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">19</span><span class=\"source-line\">    } else {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">20</span><span class=\"source-line\">        devres_free(ptr);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">21</span><span class=\"source-line\">    }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">22</span><span class=\"source-line\">    return ret;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">23</span><span class=\"source-line\">}</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1794 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1794\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">该函数的重点在第16 行的iio_device_register()函数，该函数实现了IIO 设备的注册，iio_d evice_register()函数定义在drivers/iio/industrialio-core.c 文件中，具体内容如代码清单242.13 所示：</p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单242.13</p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"7\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"source-line\">int __iio_device_register(struct iio_dev *indio_dev, struct module *this_mod)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\">{</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"source-line\">    int ret;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><span class=\"source-line\">    indio_dev-&gt;driver_module = this_mod;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6</span><span class=\"source-line\">    /* 如果调用驱动未初始化of_node，则在此处进行初始化*/</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (!indio_dev-&gt;dev.of_node &amp;&amp; indio_dev-&gt;dev.parent)</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1794 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1794\">核对原页</button></p></div>"},{"n":1795,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"8\" data-end=\"58\" data-contiguous=\"false\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8</span><span class=\"source-line\">        indio_dev-&gt;dev.of_node = indio_dev-&gt;dev.parent-&gt;of_node;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 检查扫描索引是否唯一</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11</span><span class=\"source-line\">    ret = iio_check_unique_scan_index(indio_dev);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (ret &lt; 0)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13</span><span class=\"source-line\">        return ret;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 使用主设备号和次设备号生成设备号</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16</span><span class=\"source-line\">    indio_dev-&gt;dev.devt = MKDEV(MAJOR(iio_devt), indio_dev-&gt;id);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">18</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 注册debugfs 接口</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">19</span><span class=\"source-line\">    ret = iio_device_register_debugfs(indio_dev);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">20</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (ret) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">21</span><span class=\"source-line\">        dev_err(indio_dev-&gt;dev.parent,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">22</span><span class=\"source-line\">            &quot;Failed to register debugfs interfaces\\n&quot;);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">23</span><span class=\"source-line\">        return ret;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">24</span><span class=\"source-line\">    }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">25</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">26</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 分配缓冲区相关的sysfs 接口和掩码</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">27</span><span class=\"source-line\">    ret = iio_buffer_alloc_sysfs_and_mask(indio_dev);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">28</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (ret) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">29</span><span class=\"source-line\">        dev_err(indio_dev-&gt;dev.parent,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">30</span><span class=\"source-line\">            &quot;Failed to create buffer sysfs interfaces\\n&quot;);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">31</span><span class=\"source-line\">        goto error_unreg_debugfs;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">32</span><span class=\"source-line\">    }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">33</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">34</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 注册设备的sysfs 接口</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">35</span><span class=\"source-line\">    ret = iio_device_register_sysfs(indio_dev);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">36</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (ret) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">37</span><span class=\"source-line\">        dev_err(indio_dev-&gt;dev.parent,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">38</span><span class=\"source-line\">            &quot;Failed to register sysfs interfaces\\n&quot;);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">39</span><span class=\"source-line\">        goto error_buffer_free_sysfs;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">40</span><span class=\"source-line\">    }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">41</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">42</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 注册事件集（event set）</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">43</span><span class=\"source-line\">    ret = iio_device_register_eventset(indio_dev);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">44</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (ret) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">45</span><span class=\"source-line\">        dev_err(indio_dev-&gt;dev.parent,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">46</span><span class=\"source-line\">            &quot;Failed to register event set\\n&quot;);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">47</span><span class=\"source-line\">        goto error_free_sysfs;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">48</span><span class=\"source-line\">    }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">49</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">50</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 如果设备支持所有触发模式，则注册触发消费者</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">58</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (indio_dev-&gt;modes &amp; INDIO_ALL_TRIGGERED_MODES)</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1795 页 · 行号不参与复制 · 原书行号存在跳号或重复，已按原样保留 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1795\">核对原页</button></p></div>"},{"n":1796,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"52\" data-end=\"81\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">52</span><span class=\"source-line\">        iio_device_register_trigger_consumer(indio_dev);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">53</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">54</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 如果设备支持所有缓冲模式且未设置setup_ops，则使用默认的noop_ring_setup_ops</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">55</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if ((indio_dev-&gt;modes &amp; INDIO_ALL_BUFFER_MODES) &amp;&amp;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">56</span><span class=\"source-line\">        indio_dev-&gt;setup_ops == NULL)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">57</span><span class=\"source-line\">        indio_dev-&gt;setup_ops = &amp;noop_ring_setup_ops;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">58</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">59</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 初始化字符设备结构体，并绑定文件操作函数</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">60</span><span class=\"source-line\">    cdev_init(&amp;indio_dev-&gt;chrdev, &amp;iio_buffer_fileops);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">61</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">62</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 设置字符设备的模块所有者</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">63</span><span class=\"source-line\">    indio_dev-&gt;chrdev.owner = this_mod;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">64</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">65</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 添加字符设备和设备结构体到系统中</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">66</span><span class=\"source-line\">    ret = cdev_device_add(&amp;indio_dev-&gt;chrdev, &amp;indio_dev-&gt;dev);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">67</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (ret &lt; 0)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">68</span><span class=\"source-line\">        goto error_unreg_eventset;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">69</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">70</span><span class=\"source-line\">    return 0;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">71</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">72</span><span class=\"source-line\">error_unreg_eventset:</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">73</span><span class=\"source-line\">    iio_device_unregister_eventset(indio_dev);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">74</span><span class=\"source-line\">error_free_sysfs:</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">75</span><span class=\"source-line\">    iio_device_unregister_sysfs(indio_dev);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">76</span><span class=\"source-line\">error_buffer_free_sysfs:</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">77</span><span class=\"source-line\">    iio_buffer_free_sysfs_and_mask(indio_dev);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">78</span><span class=\"source-line\">error_unreg_debugfs:</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">79</span><span class=\"source-line\">    iio_device_unregister_debugfs(indio_dev);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">80</span><span class=\"source-line\">    return ret;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">81</span><span class=\"source-line\">}</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1796 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1796\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">该函数的重点在第43 行的iio_device_register_eventset()函数，它用来注册iio 事件，定义在drivers/iio/industrialio-event.c 文件中，该函数的具体内容如代码清单242.14 所示：</p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单242.14</p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"9\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"source-line\">int iio_device_register_eventset(struct iio_dev *indio_dev)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\">{</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct iio_dev_attr *p; // 用于遍历设备属性列表的指针</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><span class=\"source-line\">    int ret = 0, attrcount_orig = 0, attrcount, attrn; //定义返回值、原始属性、总属性计数和当前属性索引</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct attribute **attr; // 指向属性数组的指针</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 如果设备没有事件属性且没有动态事件，则直接返回</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (!(indio_dev-&gt;info-&gt;event_attrs ||</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9</span><span class=\"source-line\">          iio_check_for_dynamic_events(indio_dev)))</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1796 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1796\">核对原页</button></p></div>"},{"n":1797,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"10\" data-end=\"53\" data-contiguous=\"true\" data-recovered=\"pdf-text\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10</span><span class=\"source-line\">        return 0;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12</span><span class=\"source-line\">// 分配内存以存储事件接口结构</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13</span><span class=\"source-line\">indio_dev-&gt;event_interface =</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14</span><span class=\"source-line\">        kzalloc(sizeof(struct iio_event_interface), GFP_KERNEL);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15</span><span class=\"source-line\">if (indio_dev-&gt;event_interface == NULL)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16</span><span class=\"source-line\">        return -ENOMEM;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">18</span><span class=\"source-line\">// 初始化事件接口的设备属性链表头</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">19</span><span class=\"source-line\">INIT_LIST_HEAD(&amp;indio_dev-&gt;event_interface-&gt;dev_attr_list);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">20</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">21</span><span class=\"source-line\">// 设置事件接口的中断处理函数</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">22</span><span class=\"source-line\">iio_setup_ev_int(indio_dev-&gt;event_interface);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">23</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">24</span><span class=\"source-line\">// 如果设备有预定义的事件属性，计算其数量</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">25</span><span class=\"source-line\">if (indio_dev-&gt;info-&gt;event_attrs != NULL) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">26</span><span class=\"source-line\">        attr = indio_dev-&gt;info-&gt;event_attrs-&gt;attrs;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">27</span><span class=\"source-line\">        while (*attr++ != NULL) // 遍历属性数组，统计原始属性数量</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">28</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 attrcount_orig++;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">29</span><span class=\"source-line\">}</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">30</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">31</span><span class=\"source-line\">// 初始化总属性计数为原始属性数量</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">32</span><span class=\"source-line\">attrcount = attrcount_orig;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">33</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">34</span><span class=\"source-line\">// 如果设备有通道，尝试添加动态事件配置属性</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">35</span><span class=\"source-line\">if (indio_dev-&gt;channels) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">36</span><span class=\"source-line\">        ret = __iio_add_event_config_attrs(indio_dev); // 添加动态事件属性</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">37</span><span class=\"source-line\">        if (ret &lt; 0)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">38</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 goto error_free_setup_event_lines;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">39</span><span class=\"source-line\">        attrcount += ret; // 更新总属性计数</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">40</span><span class=\"source-line\">}</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">41</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">42</span><span class=\"source-line\">// 设置事件组的名称</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">43</span><span class=\"source-line\">indio_dev-&gt;event_interface-&gt;group.name = iio_event_group_name;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">44</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">45</span><span class=\"source-line\">// 分配内存以存储事件组的属性数组</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">46</span><span class=\"source-line\">indio_dev-&gt;event_interface-&gt;group.attrs = kcalloc(attrcount + 1,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">47</span><span class=\"source-line\">                                                      sizeof(indio_dev-&gt;event_interface-&gt;group.attrs[0]),</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">48</span><span class=\"source-line\">                                                      GFP_KERNEL);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">49</span><span class=\"source-line\">if (indio_dev-&gt;event_interface-&gt;group.attrs == NULL) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">50</span><span class=\"source-line\">        ret = -ENOMEM;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">58</span><span class=\"source-line\">        goto error_free_setup_event_lines;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">52</span><span class=\"source-line\">}</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">53</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">从原书文字层恢复 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1797\">核对原页</button></p></div>"},{"n":1798,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"54\" data-end=\"82\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">54</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 如果设备有预定义的事件属性，将其复制到事件组的属性数组中</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">55</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (indio_dev-&gt;info-&gt;event_attrs)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">56</span><span class=\"source-line\">        memcpy(indio_dev-&gt;event_interface-&gt;group.attrs,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">57</span><span class=\"source-line\">               indio_dev-&gt;info-&gt;event_attrs-&gt;attrs,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">58</span><span class=\"source-line\">               sizeof(indio_dev-&gt;event_interface-&gt;group.attrs[0])</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">59</span><span class=\"source-line\">               *attrcount_orig);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">60</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">61</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 设置当前属性索引为原始属性数量</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">62</span><span class=\"source-line\">    attrn = attrcount_orig;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">63</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">64</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 遍历设备属性链表，将所有动态属性添加到事件组的属性数组中</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">65</span><span class=\"source-line\">    list_for_each_entry(p,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">66</span><span class=\"source-line\">                &amp;indio_dev-&gt;event_interface-&gt;dev_attr_list,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">67</span><span class=\"source-line\">                l)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">68</span><span class=\"source-line\">        indio_dev-&gt;event_interface-&gt;group.attrs[attrn++] =</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">69</span><span class=\"source-line\">            &amp;p-&gt;dev_attr.attr;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">70</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">71</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 将事件组添加到设备的属性组列表中</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">72</span><span class=\"source-line\">    indio_dev-&gt;groups[indio_dev-&gt;groupcounter++] =</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">73</span><span class=\"source-line\">        &amp;indio_dev-&gt;event_interface-&gt;group;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">74</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">75</span><span class=\"source-line\">    return 0;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">76</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">77</span><span class=\"source-line\">error_free_setup_event_lines:</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">78</span><span class=\"source-line\">    iio_free_chan_devattr_list(&amp;indio_dev-&gt;event_interface-&gt;dev_attr_list);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">79</span><span class=\"source-line\">    kfree(indio_dev-&gt;event_interface);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">80</span><span class=\"source-line\">    indio_dev-&gt;event_interface = NULL;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">81</span><span class=\"source-line\">    return ret;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">82</span><span class=\"source-line\">}</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1798 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1798\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">根据第13 行内存分配的代码，可以得到在iio 子系统中用来描述对应事件的结构体为stru ct iio_event_interface，该结构体的具体内容如代码清单242.15 所示：</p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单242.15</p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"10\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"source-line\">struct iio_event_interface {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\">    wait_queue_head_t wait;     // 等待队列头，用于事件通知机制</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 定义一个固定大小的FIFO 队列（大小为16），用于存储检测到的事件数据。</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 每个事件数据是一个`struct iio_event_data` 类型的结构体。</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</span><span class=\"source-line\">    DECLARE_KFIFO(det_events, struct iio_event_data, 16);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct list_head dev_attr_list;// 设备属性链表头，用于管理与事件相关的设备属性</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7</span><span class=\"source-line\">    unsigned long flags;// 标志位，用于记录事件接口的状态或特性</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct attribute_group group;// 属性组，用于将事件相关的属性组织在一起</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct mutex read_lock;// 互斥锁，用于保护对事件数据的并发访问</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10</span><span class=\"source-line\">};</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1798 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1798\">核对原页</button></p></div>"},{"n":1799,"html":"<p class=\"body-copy\">根据该结构体变量的成员可以推断出，IIO 子系统利用FIFO 队列缓存检测到的事件数据，通过等待队列唤醒监听者，通过链表维护事件属性并通过sysfs 供用户配置和监控，而互斥锁确保了多线程环境下的并发访问安全，凭标志位记录接口状态，从而高效完成事件的检测、配</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">置、存储、通知和处理。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">然后继续分析iio_device_register_eventset()函数18 行之后的代码，后续代码的主要作用是为IIO 设备初始化事件接口，先初始化事件接口的设备属性链表和中断处理函数，然后统计预定义事件属性的数量并尝试添加动态事件属性，接着分配内存存储所有事件属性并将它们整合</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">到事件组中，最后将事件组添加到设备的属性组列表中，从而完成事件接口的注册和配置。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">至此，关于devm_iio_device_register()函数就分析完成了。</p>"},{"n":1800,"html":"<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1369\"></span><h2 class=\"book-heading\">第243 章IIO 设备驱动分析</h2>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">本章将会对IIO 设备工作流程相关的驱动代码进行分析。</p>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1370\"></span><h3 class=\"book-heading\">243.1 iio 文件操作集函数分析</h3>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">在__iio_device_register()函数的第60 行通过cdev_init(&amp;indio_dev-&gt;chrdev,&amp;iio_buffer_fileop s)代码对iio 设备进行初始化，cdev_init()函数的第二个参数为iio 设备的文件操作集iio_buffer_fileops，具体内容如代码清单243.1 所示：</p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单243.1</p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"10\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"source-line\">static const struct file_operations iio_buffer_fileops = {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\">    .read = iio_buffer_read_first_n_outer_addr,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"source-line\">    .release = iio_chrdev_release,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><span class=\"source-line\">    .open = iio_chrdev_open,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</span><span class=\"source-line\">    .poll = iio_buffer_poll_addr,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6</span><span class=\"source-line\">    .owner = THIS_MODULE,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7</span><span class=\"source-line\">    .llseek = noop_llseek,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8</span><span class=\"source-line\">    .unlocked_ioctl = iio_ioctl,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9</span><span class=\"source-line\">    .compat_ioctl = iio_ioctl,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10</span><span class=\"source-line\">};</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1800 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1800\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">在本小节将对该文件操作集中的函数进行讲解。</p>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1371\"></span><h4 class=\"book-heading\">243.1.1 iio_ioctl 函数分析</h4>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">iio_ioctl 函数内容如代码清单243.2 所示：</p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单243.2</p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"12\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"source-line\">static long iio_ioctl(struct file *filp, unsigned int cmd, unsigned long arg)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\">{</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct iio_dev *indio_dev = filp-&gt;private_data; // 从文件结构中获取IIO 设备实例</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><span class=\"source-line\">    int __user *ip = (int __user *)arg;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</span><span class=\"source-line\">    int fd;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (!indio_dev-&gt;info)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8</span><span class=\"source-line\">        return -ENODEV;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (cmd == IIO_GET_EVENT_FD_IOCTL) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11</span><span class=\"source-line\">        fd = iio_event_getfd(indio_dev); // 调用函数获取事件文件描述符</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12</span><span class=\"source-line\">        if (fd &lt; 0)</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1800 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1800\">核对原页</button></p></div>"}]});
